          When obscura launch / CDP fails, automatically retry with reqwest. Default true; set `--no-auto-fallback` to disable for deterministic agent workflows that need a hard exit-3 on browser failure

      --no-auto-fallback
          Explicit disable for `--auto-fallback` (overrides the default)

